<title>USA: Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>Missouri lean hog carcass values - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY, MO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plant delivered </p>
<p>	 prices on lean slaughter</p>
<p>hogs were steady with Wednesday's close. -USDA</p>
<p>Price range (dollars/cwt) -</p>
<p>-- 48-49 percent lean, carcass weight of 181-198 lbs</p>
<p>	 78.00-81.85</p>
<p>-- 49-51 percent lean with a carcass weight of 182-210 lbs</p>
<p>	 81.75-83.43</p>
<p>Estimated Receipts: 1,850</p>
<p>Note: Producer reported prices with grade premiums or discounts included.</p>
<p>Source: Missouri Department of Agriculture-USDA Livestock Market News</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
